ab madad keeje dame imdad hai, ya ameeral momenee'n faryad hai.<br>
<br>
1. mubtelaye gham dile nashad hai<br>
 munharif charqe sitam eejad hai.<br>
 yeh zamana bar sare bedaad hai.<br>
 aap par roushan meri roodad hai.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame................................<br>
<br>
<br>
2. hai madad ka waqt ya shaahe najaf.<br>
 ek taraf mai hu zamaana ek taraf.<br>
 dijiye moula sadaaye la tahaf.<br>
 jaane sheeri'n muft hoti hai talaf.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
3. roz shab rehta hai raahat me qalal.<br>
 kal nahi ek aan dil ko aajkal.<br>
 bujh gaya hai qud ba qud dil ka kawal.<br>
 aap gar chaahe to sab uqde ho hal.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
4. ya ali ya aeliya ya abul hassan.<br>
 aye rasoole kibriya ke jaan o tan.<br>
 aye madadgare habibe zulmenan.<br>
 hai hujoome hasrato ranjo mehan.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
5. main tane tanha hu bas koi nahi.<br>
 aap bin faryad-o ras koi nahi.<br>
 dukh to ye aur hum nafas koi nahi.<br>
 dekhta hu pesh-o pas koi nahi.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
6. sab tarha ki aapko qudrat hai aaj.<br>
 jisko chaaho usko baqsho taqt o taaj.<br>
 qud ba qud afsurda rehta hai mizaaj.<br>
 aye maseeha kya karu iska ilaaj.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
7. aap hai naame quda daste quda.<br>
 aaftabe mashriqe lutfo ataa.<br>
 jaanasheen e hazrate qairul wara.<br>
 muqtada waala hasham behre saqa.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
8. hai muhabbat dil ko jo had se zyaad.<br>
 bhoolti ek dum nahi hazrat ki yaad.<br>
 aap par zaahir hai mera eteqaad.<br>
 kisse maangu phir bhala apni muraad.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
9. aapke dar ka gada hu ya ali.<br>
 naame aqdas par fida hu ya ali<br>
 laayeqe lutfo ataa hu ya ali.<br>
 qaidi e daame bala hu ya ali<br>
 <br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
10. khol do uqdo'n ka ya mushkil kusha.<br>
 thaam leeje haat ya daste quda.<br>
 aap hai kounain ke haajat rawa.<br>
 mai pukaaru kisko hazrat ke siwa.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
11. batne maahi me hue yunus jo band.<br>
 qwaar qaar gham se dil tha darmandh.<br>
 aap ne un par na aane di gazandh.<br>
 fikr me hai meri jaane mustamandh.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
12. yaa ali ya roohi o qalbi fidaak.<br>
 taaj sar hai aapke qadmo'n ki qaak.<br>
 teghe gham se hai kaleja chaak chaak.<br>
 laakh sadmo'n me hai jaane dardnaak.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
13. al ataa aye taajdare hal ataa.<br>
 al hafeez aye sheh sawaare laafatah.<br>
 al amaan aye zaighame rabbul ulaa.<br>
 al ghayaaz aye qusra o qaibar kusha.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
14. aapko roohe payambar ki qasam.<br>
 aapko zehra-e-at'har ki qasam.<br>
 aapko shabbir-o shabbar ki qasam<br>
 aapko salman-o buzar ki qasam.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
15. qurbe zainul aabidee'n ka waasta.<br>
 baqire ilme mubeen ka wasta<br>
 jaffare sahab yaqee'n ka wasta<br>
 kazime gardu'n nashee'n ka wasta.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
16. behre soze seena e moosi raza<br>
 behre ikraam e taqi e muqteda<br>
 behre anwaare naqi shaahe huda<br>
 behre ilme askari e baquda.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
17. mehdi-e haadi ka sadqa ya imam<br>
 matlabe dil mere bar aaye tamam<br>
 mujhse ho sakta nahi kuch inseraam<br>
 aap par mouqoof hai sab mere kaam.<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
18. hai ziyarat ke liye dil beqaraar<br>
 rouza e aqdas pa kyukar hu nisar<br>
 haa'n bulalo aye ameer e taajdar<br>
 aap zee qudrat hai mai be iqtiyaar<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
19. ghere rehti hai mujhe aksar bala<br>
 hind me moujood hai ghar ghar bala<br>
 ho bala gardaa'n karo door har bala<br>
 ho najaf maskan to madfan karbala<br>
 <br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
20. tab'aa me moula rawani dijiye<br>
 tishna e kousar hu pani dijiye<br>
 taaqate rangee'n bayaani dijiye<br>
 dil ko shouqe mad'ha qwaani dijiye<br>
<br>
ab madad kije dame.................................<br>
<br>
21. aapka maddaah ahqar hai anees.<br>
 sab sana khaano me kamtar hai anees<br>
 banda e salman o qambar hai anees<br>
 aajizo hairaan o muztar hai anees.